        "text": "The speaker views Senator Johnson as a source of rationality in public discourse.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes that opposing mandatory vaccinations constitutes 'spreading sanity' in a chaotic situation.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker considers the criticism of Aaron Rodgers from the political left to be predictable or expected.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker sees Aaron Rodgers as representative of Wisconsin’s values.",
