        "text": "Aaron Rodgers defended his personal health choices and freedom.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Mandates are pointless if vaccination does not prevent infection or transmission.",
        "confidence": 0.96
      },
      {
        "text": "Vaccine injuries are real and can be severe when they occur.",
